    {
      "chapter": "The experiment",
      "duration_ms": 900,
      "note": "Build a two-stage vertical-axis Savonius turbine. PETG baseline; 180 mm bucket diameter and 200 mm combined bucket height. Generator and hardware are native representative parts pending specimen fit and physical testing."
    },
    {
      "chapter": "Repeated rotor stage",
      "duration_ms": 900,
      "note": "Concentric driving diameters define a bottom disc, shaft hub and two semicircular bucket walls. One stage definition appears twice, staggered by 90 degrees. Print each stage upright and the final cap separately."
    },
